---
---

<section id="about" class="relative">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal" data-i18n="about.title">About Me</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle reveal reveal-delay-1" data-i18n="about.subtitle">A little bit about who I am</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="glass-card p-8">
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700 mb-6" data-i18n="about.p1">
            I'm lilylist, a computer engineer who loves building elegant solutions to complex problems. When I'm not writing code, you'll find me exploring new technologies, documenting my learning journey, or designing creative side projects.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700 mb-6" data-i18n="about.p2">
            I believe in writing clean, maintainable code and creating interfaces that feel as good as they look. I'm passionate about open source, continuous learning, and sharing knowledge with the community.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-lavender rounded-full text-sm text-deeppurple font-medium" data-i18n="about.tag1">Open Source</span>
            <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-blush rounded-full text-sm text-pink-600 font-medium" data-i18n="about.tag2">Clean Code</span>
            <span class="px-4 py-2 bg-purple-50 rounded-full text-sm text-purple-600 font-medium" data-i18n="about.tag3">Lifelong Learner</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="glass-card p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text mb-1">10+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-warmgray" data-i18n="about.stat_projects">Projects</div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-card p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text mb-1">50+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-warmgray" data-i18n="about.stat_posts">Blog Posts</div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-card p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text mb-1">3+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-warmgray" data-i18n="about.stat_years">Years Exp</div>
          </div>
          <div class="glass-card p-6 text-center">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold gradient-text mb-1">∞</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-warmgray" data-i18n="about.stat_curiosity">Curiosity</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
